11. Consideration of the ratification of an agreement between Laramie
County, WY, and Cheyenne Regional Air Service Focus Team
(CRAFT) in c/o LEADS. The purpose of the agreement is for the
county to pay a portion of the Minimum Revenue Guaranteed funds to
CRAFT for payments to SkyWest Airlines to provide scheduled flight
service between Cheyenne and Denver. The county shall pay CRAFT
up to $400,000 for FY25. The FY25 agreement shall terminate
automatically at the exhaustion of the $400,000 or June 30, 2025, the
end of the 2025 fiscal year, whichever is earlier.
